# packages.txt intentionally NOT ignored: Streamlit Cloud needs apt to install
# Chromium (the only reliable HTML->PDF engine on that platform). The file
# contains a single stable package name (`chromium`) which is present in
# every Debian release Streamlit Cloud has shipped. Earlier crashes came
# from exotic names (chromium-driver, chromium-browser) -- do not re-add them.
